# Verification

`VERIFY-01`: use only evidenced checks relevant to the changed scope. A declared
L1 implementation authorizes verified non-mutating checks; L2-L4 use their
approved checks. Reuse authorization while scope, commands, prerequisites, and
protected boundaries are unchanged. Mutating, external, credentialed,
destructive, dependency, signing, or configuration commands require separate
explicit authorization. Build does not replace tests; not-run never means pass.

